From: TuNaiChao <tunaichao@uniontech.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: Ship uncompressed Packages index in the test-repo fixtures

test_apt_update serves copy: sources pointing at tests/data/test-repo
and test-repo2, which only contained a compressed Packages.gz. apt
2.8.0deepin13 in the build environment fails the fetch of the plain
"Packages" index instead of falling back to the .gz variant, so the
test errors with "Failed to stat .../test-repo/Packages". Ship the
uncompressed index next to the compressed one so every apt version
finds the file it looks up first.

diff --git a/tests/data/test-repo/Packages b/tests/data/test-repo/Packages
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..fee02ac
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/data/test-repo/Packages
@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+Package: abrowser
+Priority: optional
+Section: web
+Installed-Size: 136
+Maintainer: Ubuntu Mozilla Team <ubuntu-mozillateam@lists.ubuntu.com>
+Architecture: all
+Source: firefox
+Version: 3.6.9+build1+nobinonly-0ubuntu1
+Depends: firefox, abrowser-branding
+Filename: pool/main/f/firefox/abrowser_3.6.9+build1+nobinonly-0ubuntu1_all.deb
+Size: 82324
